{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33004","headline":"送厉图南下第归澧州 · 曹邺","name":"送厉图南下第归澧州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当春人尽归，我独无归计。\n送君自多感，不是缘下第。\n君看山上草，尽有干云势。\n结根既不然，何必更掩袂。\n澧水鲈鱼贱，荆门杨柳细。\n勿爲阳艳留，此处有月桂。\n言毕尊未乾，十二门欲闭。\n伫立望不见，登高更流涕。\n吟君别我诗，怅望水烟际。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}